CE14-reagent-name-toxin-spider = Arachnotoxin
CE14-reagent-desc-toxin-spider = A venom which slows down its victim while destroying the body. Commonly found in spiders.

CE14-reagent-name-toxin-bleed = Hemoroxide
CE14-reagent-desc-toxin-bleed = A venom which causes intense bleeding. Commonly used by Cackles.

CE14-reagent-name-toxin-vuln = Depletonide
CE14-reagent-desc-toxin-vuln = A venom which causes the body to be more susceptible to damage and become fatigued. Commonly used by Spineguard's spines.
